cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Real-World Local LLM Benchmarks
message: >-
  If you use these measurements or findings, please cite this repository.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Pierri
    given-names: Michele
repository-code: "https://github.com/michele1967lux/real-world-local-llm-benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  Inference and coding-agent measurements for local LLMs on workstation
  hardware (AMD Radeon AI PRO R9700 and NVIDIA RTX 3090 Ti), including
  speculative decoding across backends, long-context behaviour, real agent
  sessions, independent coding-task evaluations, a prefix-cache livelock
  investigation, and a record of measurement errors made and retracted.
keywords:
  - llm
  - benchmark
  - speculative-decoding
  - rocm
  - cuda
  - llama.cpp
  - local-inference
  - coding-agents
license: CC-BY-4.0
